====Conjunction====
{{en-con}}

# [[since|Since]], [[because]], in light of the fact; often with ''that''.
#: {{ux|en|'''Now''' all the children have grown up and left, the house is very quiet.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Now''' that my sister has gotten rid of their cat, we can go to her house this coming Thanksgiving.}}
#: {{ux|en|We can play football '''now''' that the rain has stopped.}}
